---The custom OpenSSL cipher suite list for TLS 1.3. Requires `tlsCipherConfigMode` = `CUSTOM`; when `tlsCipherConfigMode` is omitted, supplying a non-empty list infers `CUSTOM`.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.ApiAtlasClusterAdvancedConfigurationViewCustomOpensslCipherConfigTls13List (mongodb_atlas.ApiAtlasClusterAdvancedConfigurationViewCustomOpensslCipherConfigTls13Item|string)[]

