---@class mongodb_atlas.AvailableCloudProviderRegion
---@field default? boolean Flag that indicates whether the cloud provider sets this region as its default. AWS defaults to `US_EAST_1`, GCP defaults to `CENTRAL_US`, and AZURE defaults to `US_WEST_2`.
---@field name? string Human-readable label that identifies the supported region.

---Deployments that can be migrated to MongoDB Atlas.
