---@field agentVersion? string Version of MongoDB Agent that monitors/manages the cluster.
---@field clusterId? string Unique 24-hexadecimal digit string that identifies the cluster.
---@field dbSizeBytes? number Size of this database on disk at the time of the request expressed in bytes.
---@field featureCompatibilityVersion string Version of MongoDB features that this cluster supports.
---@field managed boolean Flag that indicates whether Automation manages this cluster.
---@field mongoDBVersion string Version of MongoDB that this cluster runs.
---@field name string Human-readable label that identifies this cluster.
---@field oplogSizeMB? number Size of the Oplog on disk at the time of the request expressed in MB.
---@field sharded boolean Flag that indicates whether someone configured this cluster as a sharded cluster. - If `true`, this cluster serves as a sharded cluster. - If `false`, this cluster serves as a replica set.
---@field shardsSize? number Number of shards that comprise this cluster.
---@field tlsEnabled boolean Flag that indicates whether someone enabled TLS for this cluster.

