---@field compute? mongodb_atlas.AzureCloudProviderSettingsAutoScalingCompute Collection of settings that configures how a cluster might scale its cluster tier and whether the cluster can scale down. Cluster tier auto-scaling is unavailable for clusters using Low CPU or NVME storage classes.

