---@class mongodb_atlas.BillingInvoice
---@field amountBilledCents? number Sum of services that the specified organization consumed in the period covered in this invoice. This parameter expresses its value in cents (100ths of one US Dollar).
---@field amountPaidCents? number Sum that the specified organization paid toward this invoice. This parameter expresses its value in cents (100ths of one US Dollar).
---@field created? string Date and time when MongoDB Cloud created this invoice. This parameter expresses its value in the ISO 8601 timestamp format in UTC.
---@field creditsCents? number Sum that MongoDB credited the specified organization toward this invoice. This parameter expresses its value in cents (100ths of one US Dollar).
---@field endDate? string Date and time when MongoDB Cloud finished the billing period that this invoice covers. This parameter expresses its value in the ISO 8601 timestamp format in UTC.
---@field id? string Unique 24-hexadecimal digit string that identifies the invoice submitted to the specified organization. Charges typically post the next day.
---@field lineItems? mongodb_atlas.BillingInvoiceLineItemsList List that contains individual services included in this invoice.
---@field linkedInvoices? mongodb_atlas.BillingInvoiceLinkedInvoicesList List that contains the invoices for organizations linked to the paying organization.
---@field links? mongodb_atlas.BillingInvoiceLinksList List of one or more Uniform Resource Locators (URLs) that point to API sub-resources, related API resources, or both. RFC 5988 outlines these relationships.
---@field orgId? string Unique 24-hexadecimal digit string that identifies the organization charged for services consumed from MongoDB Cloud.
---@field payments? mongodb_atlas.BillingInvoicePaymentsList List that contains funds transferred to MongoDB to cover the specified service noted in this invoice.
---@field refunds? mongodb_atlas.BillingInvoiceRefundsList List that contains payments that MongoDB returned to the organization for this invoice.
---@field salesTaxCents? number Sum of sales tax applied to this invoice. This parameter expresses its value in cents (100ths of one US Dollar).
---@field startDate? string Date and time when MongoDB Cloud began the billing period that this invoice covers. This parameter expresses its value in the ISO 8601 timestamp format in UTC.
---@field startingBalanceCents? number Sum that the specified organization owed to MongoDB when MongoDB issued this invoice. This parameter expresses its value in US Dollars.
---@field statusName? mongodb_atlas.BillingInvoiceStatusName Phase of payment processing in which this invoice exists when you made this request. Accepted phases include: - `CLOSED`: MongoDB finalized all charges in the billing cycle but has yet to charge the customer. - `FAILED`: MongoDB attempted to charge the provided credit card but charge for that amount failed. - `FORGIVEN`: Customer initiated payment which MongoDB later forgave. - `FREE`: All charges totalled zero so the customer won't be charged. - `INVOICED`: MongoDB handled these charges using elastic invoicing. - `PAID`: MongoDB succeeded in charging the provided credit card. - `PENDING`: Invoice includes charges for the current billing cycle. - `PREPAID`: Customer has a pre-paid plan so they won't be charged.
---@field subtotalCents? number Sum of all positive invoice line items contained in this invoice. This parameter expresses its value in cents (100ths of one US Dollar).
---@field updated? string Date and time when MongoDB Cloud last updated the value of this payment. This parameter expresses its value in the ISO 8601 timestamp format in UTC.

