---@field volumeType? mongodb_atlas.CloudGCPProviderSettingsInputVolumeType|string Disk Input/Output Operations per Second (IOPS) setting for Amazon Web Services (AWS) storage that you configure only for AWS. Specify whether Disk Input/Output Operations per Second (IOPS) must not exceed the default Input/Output Operations per Second (IOPS) rate for the selected volume size (`STANDARD`), or must fall within the allowable Input/Output Operations per Second (IOPS) range for the selected volume size (`PROVISIONED` or `HIGH_PERFORMANCE`). NVMe clusters require either `PROVISIONED` or `HIGH_PERFORMANCE`.

