---@field oidcAuthType? mongodb_atlas.CreateGroupDatabaseUserRequestOidcAuthType|string Human-readable label that indicates whether the new database user or group authenticates with OIDC federated authentication. To create a federated authentication user, specify the value of USER in this field. To create a federated authentication group, specify the value of `IDP_GROUP` in this field.
