---@field endMinute? number Minute of the hour when the scheduled window to run one online archive ends. This field uses the UTC time zone. The window must have a duration of at least two hours. If the end time is before or equal to the start time, the window extends to the next day.
---@field startHour? number Hour of the day when the scheduled window to run one online archive starts. This field uses the UTC time zone.
---@field startMinute? number Minute of the hour when the scheduled window to run one online archive starts. This field uses the UTC time zone.
---@field dayOfWeek? number Day of the week when the scheduled archive starts. The week starts with Monday (`1`) and ends with Sunday (`7`).
---@field dayOfMonth? number Day of the month when the scheduled archive starts.
---@field type mongodb_atlas.DailyScheduleViewType|string Type of schedule.

