---@field updatedDate? string ISO 8601 timestamp format in UTC that indicates when the user updated the Data Protection Policy settings. MongoDB Cloud ignores this setting when you enable or update the Backup Compliance Policy settings.
---@field updatedUser? string Email address that identifies the user who updated the Backup Compliance Policy settings. MongoDB Cloud ignores this email setting when you enable or update the Backup Compliance Policy settings.

