---@field apiKey distilled.Secret API key for authentication.
---@field region mongodb_atlas.DatadogLogIntegrationResponseOutputRegion Datadog site/region for log ingestion. Valid values: US1, US3, US5, EU, AP1, AP2, US1_FED.
