---@field hecToken? string HTTP Event Collector (HEC) token for authentication.
---@field hecUrl? string HTTP Event Collector (HEC) endpoint URL.
---@field storageAccountName? string Storage account name where logs will be stored.
---@field storageContainerName? string Storage container name for log files.
