---@field raw? mongodb_atlas.Raw
---@field remoteAddress? string IPv4 or IPv6 address from which the user triggered this event.
---@field userId? string Unique 24-hexadecimal digit string that identifies the console user who triggered the event. If this resource returns this parameter, it doesn't return the `apiKeyId` parameter.
