---@field policyItems? mongodb_atlas.DiskBackupReplicaSetPolicyItemsList List that contains unique identifiers for the policy items.
---@field replicaSetName? string Human-readable label that identifies the replica set from which MongoDB Cloud took this snapshot. The resource returns this parameter when `"type": "replicaSet"`.
