---@class mongodb_atlas.DropIndexSuggestionsIndex
---@field accessCount? number Usage count (since last restart) of index.
---@field collation? mongodb_atlas.DropIndexSuggestionsIndexCollationMap Collation this index was built with. An index only serves a query that runs with the same collation. Absent when the index uses the default (simple) collation.
---@field index? mongodb_atlas.DropIndexSuggestionsIndexIndexList List that contains documents that specify a key in the index and its sort order.
---@field name? string Name of index.
---@field namespace? string Human-readable label that identifies the namespace on the specified host. The resource expresses this parameter value as `<database>.<collection>`.
---@field shards? mongodb_atlas.DropIndexSuggestionsIndexShardsList List that contains strings that specifies the shards where the index is found.
---@field since? string Date of most recent usage of index. This parameter expresses its value in the ISO 8601 timestamp format in UTC.
---@field sizeBytes? number Size of index.

---Collation this index was built with. An index only serves a query that runs with the same collation. Absent when the index uses the default (simple) collation.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.DropIndexSuggestionsIndexCollationMap { [string]: any }

---List that contains documents that specify a key in the index and its sort order.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.DropIndexSuggestionsIndexIndexList any[]

---List that contains strings that specifies the shards where the index is found.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.DropIndexSuggestionsIndexShardsList string[]

