---@field message? string Explanation of Performance Advisor availability limitations on the current tier.
---@field redundantIndexes? mongodb_atlas.DropIndexSuggestionsResponseRedundantIndexesList List that contains the documents with information about the redundant indexes that the Performance Advisor suggests to remove.
---@field scale? mongodb_atlas.ApiClusterScaleView
---@field unusedIndexes? mongodb_atlas.DropIndexSuggestionsResponseUnusedIndexesList List that contains the documents with information about the unused indexes that the Performance Advisor suggests to remove.

