---@field metricThreshold? mongodb_atlas.FlexClusterMetricThreshold
---@field notifications mongodb_atlas.FlexMetricAlertConfigViewForNdsGroupNotificationsList List that contains the targets that MongoDB Cloud sends notifications.
---@field severityOverride? mongodb_atlas.EventSeverity
---@field updated? string Date and time when someone last updated this alert configuration. This parameter expresses its value in the ISO 8601 timestamp format in UTC.

