---@field since? number Date and time from which to retrieve query shape statistics. This parameter expresses its value in the number of milliseconds that have elapsed since the [UNIX epoch](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unix_time). - If you don't specify the **until** parameter, the endpoint returns data covering from the **since** value and the current time. - If you specify neither the **since** nor the **until** parameters, the endpoint returns data from the previous 24 hours.
