---@field pretty? boolean Flag that indicates whether the response body should be in the prettyprint format.
---@field duration? number Length of time expressed during which the query finds suggested indexes among the managed namespaces in the cluster. This parameter expresses its value in milliseconds. - If you don't specify the **since** parameter, the endpoint returns data covering the duration before the current time. - If you specify neither the **duration** nor **since** parameters, the endpoint returns data from the previous 24 hours.
---@field since? number Date and time from which the query retrieves the suggested indexes. This parameter expresses its value in the number of milliseconds that have elapsed since the [UNIX epoch](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unix_time). - If you don't specify the **duration** parameter, the endpoint returns data covering from the **since** value and the current time. - If you specify neither the **duration** nor the **since** parameters, the endpoint returns data from the previous 24 hours.

