---@class mongodb_atlas.MdbAvailableVersion
---@field cloudProvider? mongodb_atlas.MdbAvailableVersionCloudProvider Cloud service provider on which MongoDB Cloud provisions the hosts. Set dedicated clusters to `AWS`, `GCP`, `AZURE` or `TENANT`.
---@field defaultStatus? mongodb_atlas.MdbAvailableVersionDefaultStatus Whether the version is the current default for the Instance Size and Cloud Provider.
---@field instanceSize? mongodb_atlas.BaseCloudProviderInstanceSize
---@field links? mongodb_atlas.MdbAvailableVersionLinksList List of one or more Uniform Resource Locators (URLs) that point to API sub-resources, related API resources, or both. RFC 5988 outlines these relationships.
---@field version? string The MongoDB Major Version in question.

---Cloud service provider on which MongoDB Cloud provisions the hosts. Set dedicated clusters to `AWS`, `GCP`, `AZURE` or `TENANT`.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.MdbAvailableVersionCloudProvider "AWS"|"AZURE"|"GCP"|"TENANT"

---Whether the version is the current default for the Instance Size and Cloud Provider.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.MdbAvailableVersionDefaultStatus "DEFAULT"|"NOT_DEFAULT"

---List of one or more Uniform Resource Locators (URLs) that point to API sub-resources, related API resources, or both. RFC 5988 outlines these relationships.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.MdbAvailableVersionLinksList mongodb_atlas.Link[]

