---@field cidrBlock? string Range of IP addresses in Classless Inter-Domain Routing (CIDR) notation that you want to add to the project's IP access list. Your IP access list entry can be one `awsSecurityGroup`, one `cidrBlock`, or one `ipAddress`. Don't set this parameter if you set `awsSecurityGroup` or `ipAddress`.
---@field comment? string Remark that explains the purpose or scope of this IP access list entry.
