---@field ipAddress? string IP address that you want to add to the project's IP access list. Your IP access list entry can be one `awsSecurityGroup`, one `cidrBlock`, or one `ipAddress`. Don't set this parameter if you set `awsSecurityGroup` or `cidrBlock`.

