---@field apiKey distilled.Secret Key that allows MongoDB Cloud to access your OpsGenie account. **NOTE**: After you create a notification which requires an API or integration key, the key appears partially redacted when you: * View or edit the alert through the Atlas UI. * Query the alert for the notification through the Atlas Administration API.
---@field id? string|distilled.Null Integration id.
---@field region? mongodb_atlas.OpsGenieRegion Two-letter code that indicates which regional URL MongoDB uses to access the OpsGenie API.
---@field type? mongodb_atlas.OpsGenieType Human-readable label that identifies the service to which you want to integrate with MongoDB Cloud. The value must match the third-party service integration type.

