---@field firstName string First or given name that belongs to the MongoDB Cloud user.
---@field lastAuth? string Date and time when the current account last authenticated. This value is in the ISO 8601 timestamp format in UTC.
---@field lastName string Last name, family name, or surname that belongs to the MongoDB Cloud user.
---@field mobileNumber? string Mobile phone number that belongs to the MongoDB Cloud user.
---@field id string Unique 24-hexadecimal digit string that identifies the MongoDB Cloud user.
---@field orgMembershipStatus mongodb_atlas.OrgActiveUserResponseOrgMembershipStatus String enum that indicates the user's organization membership status: ACTIVE (member), PENDING (invited), `INVITATION_EXPIRED` (invitation expired), or `INVITATION_REJECTED` (invitation declined).
