---@field invitationExpiresAt? string|distilled.Null Date and time when the invitation from MongoDB Cloud expires. MongoDB Cloud represents this timestamp in ISO 8601 format in UTC. This field is absent for active users and null for rejected invitations.
---@field inviterUsername? string Username of the MongoDB Cloud user who sent the invitation to join the organization.

