---Organization notification configuration for MongoDB Cloud to send information when an event triggers an alert condition.
---@class mongodb_atlas.OrgNotification
---@field delayMin? number Number of minutes that MongoDB Cloud waits after detecting an alert condition before it sends out the first notification.
---@field emailEnabled? boolean Flag that indicates whether MongoDB Cloud should send email notifications. The resource requires this parameter when one of the following values have been set: - `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "ORG"` - `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "GROUP"` - `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "USER"`
---@field intervalMin? number Number of minutes to wait between successive notifications. MongoDB Cloud sends notifications until someone acknowledges the unacknowledged alert. PagerDuty, VictorOps, and OpsGenie notifications don't return this element. Configure and manage the notification interval within each of those services.
---@field notifierId? string The `notifierId` is a system-generated unique identifier assigned to each notification method. This is needed when updating third-party notifications without requiring explicit authentication credentials.
---@field roles? mongodb_atlas.OrgNotificationRolesList List that contains the one or more organization roles that receive the configured alert. This parameter is available when `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "GROUP"` or `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "ORG"`. If you include this parameter, MongoDB Cloud sends alerts only to users assigned the roles you specify in the array. If you omit this parameter, MongoDB Cloud sends alerts to users assigned any role.
---@field smsEnabled? boolean Flag that indicates whether MongoDB Cloud should send text message notifications. The resource requires this parameter when one of the following values have been set: - `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "ORG"` - `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "GROUP"` - `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "USER"`
---@field typeName mongodb_atlas.OrgNotificationTypeName|string Human-readable label that displays the alert notification type.

---One or more organization roles that receive the configured alert.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.OrgNotificationRolesItem "ORG_OWNER"|"ORG_MEMBER"|"ORG_GROUP_CREATOR"|"ORG_BILLING_ADMIN"|"ORG_BILLING_READ_ONLY"|"ORG_READ_ONLY"

---List that contains the one or more organization roles that receive the configured alert. This parameter is available when `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "GROUP"` or `"notifications.[n].typeName" : "ORG"`. If you include this parameter, MongoDB Cloud sends alerts only to users assigned the roles you specify in the array. If you omit this parameter, MongoDB Cloud sends alerts to users assigned any role.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.OrgNotificationRolesList (mongodb_atlas.OrgNotificationRolesItem|string)[]

---Human-readable label that displays the alert notification type.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.OrgNotificationTypeName "ORG"

