---@field iamRoleId? string Unique 24-character hexadecimal string that identifies the AWS IAM role that Atlas uses to access the S3 bucket.
---@field kmsKey? string|distilled.Null AWS KMS key ID or ARN for server-side encryption (optional). If not provided, uses bucket default encryption settings.
---@field useLegacyPathStructure? boolean When true, uses the legacy daily-folder path structure compatible with Push-Based Log Export: `{prefix}/{cluster}/{hostname}/{logType}/{YYYY-MM-DD}/{timestamp}-{logType}.log`. When false (default), uses the flat timestamped structure: `{prefix}/{cluster}/{hostname}/{logType}/{timestamp}-{logType}.log`.

