---@class mongodb_atlas.PerformanceAdvisorIndex
---@field avgObjSize? number The average size of an object in the collection of this index.
---@field collation? mongodb_atlas.PerformanceAdvisorIndexCollationMap Collation the queries behind this suggestion run with. An index only serves a query when the two share a collation, so an index created from this suggestion must be created with it. Absent when those queries use the default (simple) collation.
---@field id? string Unique 24-hexadecimal digit string that identifies this index.
---@field impact? mongodb_atlas.PerformanceAdvisorIndexImpactList List that contains unique 24-hexadecimal character string that identifies the query shapes in this response that the Performance Advisor suggests.
---@field index? mongodb_atlas.PerformanceAdvisorIndexIndexList List that contains documents that specify a key in the index and its sort order.
---@field namespace? string Human-readable label that identifies the namespace on the specified host. The resource expresses this parameter value as `<database>.<collection>`.
---@field weight? number Estimated performance improvement that the suggested index provides. This value corresponds to **Impact** in the Performance Advisor user interface.

---Collation the queries behind this suggestion run with. An index only serves a query when the two share a collation, so an index created from this suggestion must be created with it. Absent when those queries use the default (simple) collation.
