---@class mongodb_atlas.PerformanceAdvisorOpStats
---@field ms? number Length of time expressed during which the query finds suggested indexes among the managed namespaces in the cluster. This parameter expresses its value in milliseconds. This parameter relates to the **duration** query parameter.
---@field nReturned? number Number of results that the query returns.
---@field nScanned? number Number of documents that the query read.
---@field ts? number Date and time from which the query retrieves the suggested indexes. This parameter expresses its value in the number of seconds that have elapsed since the UNIX epoch. This parameter relates to the **since** query parameter.

