---@field predicates? mongodb_atlas.PerformanceAdvisorOperationViewPredicatesList List that contains the search criteria that the query uses. To use the values in key-value pairs in these predicates requires **Project Observability Viewer** or **Project Data Access Read Only** permissions or greater. Otherwise, MongoDB Cloud redacts these values.
---@field raw? string|distilled.Null Opaque serialized raw slow query log line or query shape for the query shape to be improved with index suggestions. The format isn't stable, so don't parse this value. Accessing this value requires **Project Observability Viewer** or **Project Data Access Read Only** permissions or greater. Otherwise, MongoDB Cloud returns `null`.
