---Metrics from a slow query log.
---@class mongodb_atlas.PerformanceAdvisorSlowQueryMetrics
---@field docsExamined? number The number of documents in the collection that MongoDB scanned in order to carry out the operation.
---@field docsExaminedReturnedRatio? number Ratio of documents examined to documents returned.
---@field docsReturned? number The number of documents returned by the operation.
---@field fromUserConnection? boolean This boolean will be true when the server can identify the query source as non-server. This field is only available for MDB 8.0+.
---@field hasAutoEmbedding? boolean Flag that indicates whether the slow query used automated embedding, where MongoDB Cloud generates embeddings from raw text at query time instead of the client supplying a precomputed vector.
---@field hasIndexCoverage? boolean Indicates if the query has index coverage.
---@field hasRerank? boolean Flag that indicates whether the slow query used the `$rerank` aggregation stage, which reorders results using Voyage AI reranking models. Always `false` for MongoDB deployments earlier than 8.3.
---@field hasSort? boolean This boolean will be true when a query cannot use the ordering in the index to return the requested sorted results; i.e. MongoDB must sort the documents after it receives the documents from a cursor.
---@field keysExamined? number The number of index keys that MongoDB scanned in order to carry out the operation.
---@field keysExaminedReturnedRatio? number Ratio of keys examined to documents returned.
---@field numYields? number The number of times the operation yielded to allow other operations to complete.
---@field operationExecutionTime? number Total execution time of a query in milliseconds.
---@field responseLength? number The length in bytes of the operation's result document.
---@field tokensUsed? number The total inference tokens consumed by this operation, including tokens used by `$rerank`. Returned only for inference queries that consumed tokens; it is omitted otherwise, including for MongoDB deployments earlier than 8.3.

