---@field active boolean Flag that indicates whether query sampling is observably running on the namespace. May still be `false` in the response to a successful create request; it becomes `true` asynchronously once the cluster applies the sampling configuration.
---@field namespace string Human-readable label that identifies the namespace (`<database>.<collection>`) on which queries are sampled.
---@field sampledReadsBytes? number|distilled.Null Total size in bytes of the read operations sampled on the namespace.
---@field sampledReadsCount? number|distilled.Null Number of read operations sampled on the namespace.
---@field sampledWritesBytes? number|distilled.Null Total size in bytes of the write operations sampled on the namespace.
---@field sampledWritesCount? number|distilled.Null Number of write operations sampled on the namespace.
---@field samplesPerSecond? number|distilled.Null Maximum number of queries sampled per second on the namespace. MongoDB Cloud sets this rate.
