---Metadata and summary statistics for a given query shape.
---@class mongodb_atlas.QueryStatsDetailsResponse
---@field firstSeen? mongodb_atlas.QueryShapeSeenMetadata
---@field lastSeen? mongodb_atlas.QueryShapeSeenMetadata
---@field queryStats? mongodb_atlas.QueryStatsSummary
---@field queryStatsCollection? mongodb_atlas.QueryStatsCollectionResponse

---A summary of execution statistics for a given query shape.
---@class mongodb_atlas.QueryStatsSummary
---@field avgTimeToResponseMicros? number Average time in microseconds from the beginning of query processing to the first server response, per execution of queries with the given query shape. Calculated as `totalTimeToResponseMicros` divided by `execCount` over the requested time range. As a duration it can be longer or shorter than `avgWorkingMillis` (reported in milliseconds, so convert before comparing): longer when executions spent time blocked on locks or flow control rather than working, shorter when they kept working after the first batch to return later `getMore` batches.
---@field avgWorkingMillis? number Average active execution time in milliseconds per execution of queries with the given query shape, calculated as `totalWorkingMillis` divided by `execCount` over the requested time range. Excludes intentional pauses such as time waiting on locks or flow control.
---@field bytesRead? number The number of bytes read by the given query shape from the disk to the cache.
---@field command? mongodb_atlas.QueryStatsSummaryCommand The MongoDB command issued for this query shape. The insert, update, and delete commands appear only for clusters running MongoDB 9.0 or later.
---@field cpuTime? number|distilled.Null Total CPU time in nanoseconds consumed by queries with the given query shape. Available for MDB 8.2 and higher.
---@field docsExamined? number Total number of documents examined by queries with the given query shape.
---@field docsExaminedRatio? number Ratio of documents examined to documents returned by queries with the given query shape.
---@field docsReturned? number Total number of documents returned by queries with the given query shape.
---@field execCount? number Total number of times that queries with the given query shape have been executed.
---@field keysDeleted? number|distilled.Null Total number of index keys deleted by queries with the given query shape. Available for MongoDB 9.0+ write commands.
---@field keysExamined? number Total number of in-bounds and out-of-bounds index keys examined by queries with the given query shape.
---@field keysExaminedRatio? number Ratio of in-bounds and out-of-bounds index keys examined to indexes containing documents returned by queries with the given query shape.
---@field keysInserted? number|distilled.Null Total number of index keys inserted by queries with the given query shape. Available for MongoDB 9.0+ write commands.
---@field lastExecMicros? number Execution runtime in microseconds for the most recent query with the given query shape.
---@field nDeleted? number|distilled.Null Total number of documents deleted by queries with the given query shape. Available for MongoDB 9.0+ write commands.
---@field nInserted? number|distilled.Null Total number of documents inserted by queries with the given query shape. Available for MongoDB 9.0+ write commands.
---@field nMatched? number|distilled.Null Total number of documents matched by queries with the given query shape. Available for MongoDB 9.0+ write commands.
---@field nModified? number|distilled.Null Total number of documents modified by queries with the given query shape. Available for MongoDB 9.0+ write commands.
---@field nUpserted? number|distilled.Null Total number of documents upserted by queries with the given query shape. Available for MongoDB 9.0+ write commands.
---@field namespace? string Human-readable label that identifies the namespace on the specified host. The resource expresses this parameter value as `<database>.<collection>`.
---@field p50ExecMicros? number The 50th percentile value of execution time in microseconds. This field is deprecated as the values it reports may be inaccurate. It will be removed in a future release.
---@field p90ExecMicros? number The 90th percentile value of execution time in microseconds. This field is deprecated as the values it reports may be inaccurate. It will be removed in a future release.
---@field p99ExecMicros? number The 99th percentile value of execution time in microseconds. This field is deprecated as the values it reports may be inaccurate. It will be removed in a future release.
---@field queryShape? string A query shape is a set of specifications that group similar queries together. Specifications can include filters, sorts, projections, aggregation pipeline stages, a namespace, and others. Queries that have similar specifications have the same query shape.
---@field queryShapeHash? string A hexadecimal string that represents the hash of a MongoDB query shape.
---@field systemQuery? boolean Indicates whether this query shape represents a system-initiated query.
---@field totalTimeToResponseMicros? number Total time in microseconds from the beginning of query processing to the first server response, summed across executions of queries with the given query shape. Includes time spent waiting on locks or flow control. Stops at the first batch of results, so time spent serving later `getMore` batches is not counted.
---@field totalWorkingMillis? number Total time in milliseconds that queries with the given query shape spent actively executing, summed across executions, including time spent processing `getMore` requests. Excludes intentional pauses such as time waiting on locks or flow control, and time spent waiting for the client.

---The MongoDB command issued for this query shape. The insert, update, and delete commands appear only for clusters running MongoDB 9.0 or later.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.QueryStatsSummaryCommand "find"|"distinct"|"aggregate"|"count"|"insert"|"update"|"delete"

