---@class mongodb_atlas.SearchOrgInvoiceLineItemsRequest
---@field orgId string Unique 24-hexadecimal digit string that identifies the organization that contains your projects. Use the [`/orgs`](#tag/Organizations/operation/listOrganizations) endpoint to retrieve all organizations to which the authenticated user has access.
---@field invoiceId string Unique 24-hexadecimal digit string that identifies the invoice submitted to the specified organization. Charges typically post the next day.
---@field envelope? boolean Flag that indicates whether Application wraps the response in an `envelope` JSON object. Some API clients cannot access the HTTP response headers or status code. To remediate this, set envelope=true in the query. Endpoints that return a list of results use the results object as an envelope. Application adds the status parameter to the response body.
---@field itemsPerPage? number Number of items that the response returns per page.
---@field pageNum? number Number of the page that displays the current set of the total objects that the response returns.
---@field filters? mongodb_atlas.UsageDetailsFilterRequest
---@field sortField? mongodb_atlas.SearchOrgInvoiceLineItemsRequestSortField|string Specify the field used to specify how to sort query results. Default to bill date.
---@field sortOrder? mongodb_atlas.SearchOrgInvoiceLineItemsRequestSortOrder|string Specify the sort order (ascending / descending) used to specify how to sort query results. Defaults to descending.

---Specify the field used to specify how to sort query results. Default to bill date.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.SearchOrgInvoiceLineItemsRequestSortField "USAGE_DATES"|"BILL_DATES"|"TOTAL_PRICE_CENTS"

---Specify the sort order (ascending / descending) used to specify how to sort query results. Defaults to descending.
---@alias mongodb_atlas.SearchOrgInvoiceLineItemsRequestSortOrder "ASCENDING"|"DESCENDING"

