---@field apiToken distilled.Secret Key that allows MongoDB Cloud to access your Slack account. **NOTE**: After you create a notification which requires an API or integration key, the key appears partially redacted when you: * View or edit the alert through the Atlas UI. * Query the alert for the notification through the Atlas Administration API. **IMPORTANT**: Slack integrations now use the OAuth2 verification method and must be initially configured, or updated from a legacy integration, through the Atlas third-party service integrations page. Legacy tokens will soon no longer be supported.
---@field channelName string|distilled.Null Name of the Slack channel to which MongoDB Cloud sends alert notifications.
