---@field processorErrorMsg? string The error message associated with the Stream Processor to which this alert applies.
---@field processorName? string The name of the Stream Processor to which this alert applies. The resource returns this parameter for alerts of events impacting Stream Processors.
---@field processorState? string The state of the Stream Processor to which this alert applies. The resource returns this parameter for alerts of events impacting Stream Processors.
---@field resolved? string Date and time that this alert changed to `"status" : "CLOSED"`. This parameter expresses its value in the ISO 8601 timestamp format in UTC. The resource returns this parameter once `"status" : "CLOSED"`.
